# Desktop (Electron)

- electron-vite + React + strict TypeScript
- Aliases: `@core/*` → `src/core/*`, `@/*` → `src/renderer/src/*`
- Cross-process domain in `src/core/` (auth, catalog, downloads, playback, profile, progress, platform, ipc)
- Main process by domain: `main/{app,window,media,catalog,downloads,progress,profile,session,db,ipc}/`
- Renderer: Feature-Sliced Design — `app/ pages/ widgets/ features/ entities/ shared/` with slice `index.ts` public APIs
- Enforce FSD with steiger (`npm run lint:fsd`)
- Close/minimize → hide to tray; `app.quit()` only from tray «Exit»
- `WindowLifecycleManager` with `isQuitting` flag
- Supabase JS auth with offline-safe session handling
- UI copy: Russian literals inline at usage sites (no central i18n module)
- Modules ideally ~≤200 lines; prefer splitting over god-files
